  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_maund_cb60fa22a093ed10bc21f1a59b5b9b385669b2ff97c740571ed9a5a2833354b54a">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>maund, a wicker or other woven basket with a handle or handles, hence a basketful as a measure of capacity, particulary of wheat (Zupko 243-4, OED s.v. maund n.1), but here generally as a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size | as an article of commerce | maund, a wicker or other woven basket with a handle or handles, hence a basketful as a measure of capacity, particulary of wheat (Zupko 243-4, OED s.v. maund n.1), but here generally as a unit of packing of no particular size | maund, a wicker or other woven basket with a handle or handles, hence a basketful as a measure of capacity, particulary of wheat (Zupko 243-4, OED s.v. maund n.1), but here as a unit of packing of no particular size | maund, a wicker or other woven basket with a handle or handles, hence a basketful as a measure of capacity, particulary of wheat (Zupko 243-4, OED s.v. maund n.1), but here as a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size | maunde, as an article of commerce | of varnish | of battery | maund, a wicker or other woven basket with a handle or handles, hence basketful as a measure of capacity (Zupko 243-4) | maund, a wicker or other woven basket with a handle or handles, hence a basketful as a measure of capacity, particulary of wheat (Zupko 243-4, OED s.v. maund n.1), but here generally as a unit of packing | maund, a wicker or other woven basket with a handle or handles, hence a basketful as a measure of capacity, particulary of wheat (Zupko 243-4, OED s.v. maund n.1), but here as a unit of packing for dry goods | maund, a wicker or other woven basket with a handle or handles, hence a basketful as a measure of capacity, particulary of wheat (Zupko 243-4, OED s.v. maund n.1), but here as a unit of packing | maund, a wicker or other woven basket with a handle or handles, hence a basketful as a measure of capacity, particularly of wheat (Zupko 243-4, OED s.v. maund n.1), but here as a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size | meaning unknown</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
